st files.","evidence":"The node:test convention is confirmed by the existing tracker test (src/workflow/__tests__/tracker-auto.test.ts imports node:test). Minor location imprecision: existing tracker tests live at src/workflow/__tests__/, not src/workflow/tracker/ as the LLD's framework note says — non-breaking; the impl should follow the existing __tests__/ location.","action":"Place the new tests at src/workflow/__tests__/ (existing tracker-test location), not src/workflow/tracker/.","fixability":"manual"}],"counts":{"high":0,"med":1,"low":8},"reviewedAt":"2026-07-22T11:28:22.868Z","model":"client"},"resolutions":{"c6":{"findingId":"c6","status":"resolved","note":"Resolved (option 1): current-user login resolves via `gh api /user --jq .login` issued through the existing TrackerExec seam (the same gh api /user call at tracker/github.ts:241) — NOT config/github.ts, which resolves repo config only. Build must add a currentGithubLogin(exec) helper and use it in listMyOpenTasks.","resolvedAt":"2026-07-22T11:38:07.122Z"}}}}}}
